title: Organizing and Campaigning
new-page: true
view-if: b_organizing_timer <= 0
on-arrival: b_organizing_timer += 2; week_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
card-image: img/lenin_putilov.jpg
tags: b_party

= Organizing and Campaigning

Social Democrats have been organizing among the working class for decades, and have built a formidable base. However, they may not be enough for the revolution. Which groups should we focus our organizing efforts on?

- @soldiers
- @workers
- @rural
- @middle_class
- @intelligentsia
- @students
- @root: We don't need to organize right now.
- @easy_discard

@soldiers
title: Soldiers at the front and in the garrisons.
subtitle: -1 resource2
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – We lack the resources. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.soldiers_b += 6*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.b_soldiers_org += 1;
  Q.soldiers_unrest -= 8;
  if (Q.war_weariness >= 50 && Q.b_in_gov == 1) {
    Q.soldiers_b -= 3;
    Q.b_soldiers_org -= 1;
    Q.soldiers_unrest += 4; 
  }
!}

We have increased our organizing among the soldiers. [? if war_weariness >= 50 and b_in_gov == 1 : Current  war exhaustion limits the effectiveness of our propaganda. ?]

@workers
title: The urban proletariat, the core of our base.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – We lack the resources. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.workers_b += 6*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.b_workers_org += 1; 
  Q.workers_unrest -= 8;
!}

We have increased our organizing among the workers.

@rural
title: The peasantry in the countryside. 
subtitle: -1 resources — This will be very difficult, as we do not have a traditional base among the peasantry.
choose-if: resources >= 1 
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – We lack the resources. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.peasants_b += 5*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.b_peasants_org += 1;
  Q.kulaks_b += 2*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 5;
  Q.ca_support_timer -= 0.5; 
!}

We have increased our organizing among the peasants. 

The middle class has never been a subject of our organizing efforts, but that may change.

@middle_class
title: The petty-bourgeois businessowners and professionals. 
subtitle: -1 resources – These groups are not part of our base.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – We lack the resources. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.middle_b += 3*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.b_middle_class_org += 1;
  Q.kulaks_b += 2*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.middle_unrest -= 8; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 3; 
!}

The middle class has never been a subject of our organizing efforts, but that may change.

@intelligentsia
title: Make appeals to the intelligentsia. 
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – We lack the resources. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.intelligentsia_b += 4*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.intelligentsia_unrest -= 8; 
  Q.bourgeois_specialists_unrest -= 4; 
!}

We improve our relations with the country's intellectual elites. 

@students
title: The students on college campuses. 
subtitle: -1 resources 
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – We lack the resources. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.students_b += 8*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.students_unrest -= 8; Q.red_specialists_unrest -= 8;
  Q.school_loyalty += 0.05; 
!}

